    HUB -->|"③ 兜底"| WLR["wlroots 协议\nzwlr_virtual_pointer\n无弹窗"]

    KYLIN --> EIS["EIS fd → libei 线协议 → 合成器"]
    PORTAL --> EIS
    WLR --> COMP["直接 Wayland 协议 → 合成器"]

